# Cline Project Rules

This file is an adapter for Cline. The canonical agent guide is **AGENTS.md**
(repo root); longer workflows live in `.github/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. Keep
adapter-specific notes below; everything else stays in the canonical sources.

## Commit Message Skill

Commit messages are handled by the shared `commit-message` skill. See
`.github/skills/commit-message/SKILL.md` for the canonical definition (workflow,
guardrails, types, rules, and examples).

Commit messages follow the Conventional Commits specification.
